# Install as /usr/lib/tmpfiles.d/agentcapsule-authority.conf (systemd-tmpfiles).
# The authority service's sockets, created at boot, before the service, the
# worker or the API starts. The set-group-ID bit gives the sockets the group
# agentcapsule-authority-clients: worker.sock is mode 0600 (root only),
# api.sock 0660 (the API's account, a member of that group).
d /run/agentcapsule-authority 2750 agentcapsule-authority agentcapsule-authority-clients -
# init-restore-authority resolves the worker's data path during upgrades as
# the authority user: it traverses the parent, never lists it. Root's and
# 0711, as the installer creates it and an update's searchable_parent leaves
# it; what it holds keeps its own modes.
d /var/lib/agentcapsule 0711 root root -
